      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/dc4da7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-24T13:58:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Last night, we were playing against Baron Blade with 5 people: The Wraith, Absolute Zero, Legend, The Visionary, and Haka (in that order). We got Baron Blade down to 1HP when it was Absolute Zero’s turn. He had died (actually, killed himself) and used his power to “destroy a card that has 1HP”. When he destroyed, was it gone, didn’t need to flip the card, or were we supposed to flip the card?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!</p>",
