      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-25T00:53:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I ‘ruled’ the other way because it doesn’t say anywhere on the cards anything about damage, thus things that are immune to damage would be destroyed anyway (same with Tachyon’s <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Sucker Punch</span>)… but I can see the other side of the argument, I just see it as taking something out without doing damage</p>",
