    {
      "id": 33914,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-25T01:20:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just thought I’d go ahead and preview this, as I think it might clear things up:</p>\n<p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p>\n<p>What it comes down to is this: when a target is reduce to 0 or fewer HP, it should be destroyed.  So, as in the case of Baron Blade, if something else should happen, it ought to be noted on the card.<br>\nIt’s my fault for not making it clear originally.  Hope this helps.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:07:51.780Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
