      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Just thought I'd go ahead and preview this, as I think it might clear things up:\n\n[img]http://greaterthangames.info/wp-uploads/2012/06/newblade-719x1024.jpg[/img]\n\nWhat it comes down to is this: when a target is reduce to 0 or fewer HP, it should be destroyed.  So, as in the case of Baron Blade, if something else should happen, it ought to be noted on the card.  \nIt's my fault for not making it clear originally.  Hope this helps.",
