      "created_at": "2012-06-25T03:34:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I hate to say this but, there’s still errors. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Instruction card Terralunar side, under setup. “At the start of the game, put Baron Blade’s villain character cards into play “<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Terralun<em><strong>e</strong></em>r</span> Impulsion…””</li>\n<li>Same side, under Game Play, 2nd paragraph, 2 instances of “Baron Blade” should be in italics but is not.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Oh, GtG, please let me proof read your proofs before final printing… “Gotta catch’em all!”</p>",
